            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f3" n="2" xml:id="d32-f3-content">
                <p>For text of Senate Resolution 239 (the Vandenberg Resolution), June 11, 1948,
                    which expressed support for the association of the United States with regional
                    collective defense arrangements, see <ref target="frus1948v03#pg_135">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 135</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f4" n="3" xml:id="d32-f4-content">
                <p>Of July 1, <ref target="#pg585">p. 585</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f5" n="4" xml:id="d32-f5-content">
                <p>For documentation on United States assistance to China under the $125,000,000
                    grant of the China Aid Act, see <ref target="frus1948v08#pg_73">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">viii</hi>, pp. 73</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f6" n="5" xml:id="d32-f6-content">
                <p>For documentation on United States military assistance to Iran, see <ref
                        target="frus1948v05p1#pg_88">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, Part
                        1, pp. 88</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d32-f7" n="6" xml:id="d32-f7-content">
                <p>For documentation on the position of the United States regarding military
                    assistance to Argentina, see <ref target="frus1948v09#pg_310">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ix</hi>, pp. 310</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
